      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pembroke%2C_Massachusetts"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "An iron furnace was established in Pembroke in 1702, making it one of the earliest industrial sites in the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
