      ],
      "source": "https://www.pembroke-ma.gov/1719/Discover-Pembroke"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Shipbuilding and box manufacturing drove Pembroke’s growth, with box factories producing shoe boxes for nearby shoe industry and crates for cranberry and poultry.",
